 ਦੀਜੈ ॥","translit_en":"dhrumaj baasanee pun padh dheejai ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਫਿਰ 'ਦ੍ਰੁਮਜ ਬਾਸਨੀ' (ਬ੍ਰਿਛ ਦੇ ਪੁੱਤਰ ਲਕੜ ਨਾਲ ਵਸਣ ਵਾਲੀ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ।"}}},{"verse_id":107425,"page_no":748,"line_no":107425,"gurmukhi":"ਚੀਨ ਨਾਮ ਨਾਲੀ ਕੋ ਲੀਜੈ ॥੬੭੪॥","translit_en":"cheen naam naalee ko leejai ||674||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"Uttering firstly the words “Kaashth-Prashthani” and thinking about all the names of Tupak and then adding the words “Drum-Vaasani”, recognize the name of “Naalidaar Tupak”.674."},"pu":{"ss":"ਇਹ ਨਾਲੀ (ਤੁਪਕ) ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੈ ॥੬੭੪॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":9489,"next":9491}}